# qwen2.5:0.5b-sub — the sub-agent: a tiny, RAM-only companion model.
#
# Runs ENTIRELY in RAM (num_gpu 0): this 2 GB GeForce 840M is already holding the
# resident 7B at 1475 MiB, and offloading the 0.5B to VRAM causes CUDA OOMs or evicts
# the 7B (measured). RAM-only is what lets both models co-reside.
#
# Small context (1024) is the other half of co-residency: at 8192 the KV cache pushes
# total memory past what this 7.7 GB box has free and Ollama evicts the 7B. A sub-agent
# only ever sees ONE task at a time, so 1024 tokens is plenty.
#
# Low temperature: the sub-agent does determinism-first work (titles, extraction,
# one-shot lookups) where a confident, terse answer beats creative flair.
#
# Apply with:
#   ollama create qwen2.5:0.5b-sub -f Modelfile.subagent
#
# The 397 MB of weights are shared with qwen2.5:0.5b (FROM below) — no disk duplication.

FROM qwen2.5:0.5b

PARAMETER num_gpu 0
PARAMETER num_thread 2
PARAMETER num_ctx 1024
PARAMETER temperature 0.4